  exitDialoguesPassed:
    lastVerdict: 1
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Thanks. You should probably fix that light soon.
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Try not to look at the sky for too long today.
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - "Enjoy the view, officer. It\u2019s quite a show."
  exitDialoguesQuarantined:
    lastVerdict: 2
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - "Wait, why? I\u2019m not sick!"
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - "A cell? That\u2019s fine. The view is the same from anywhere."
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Isolation is just a head start on the end. I don't mind.
  exitDialoguesKilled:
    lastVerdict: 3
    dialoguesEarlyDays:
    - Wait... what are you doing?!?
    dialoguesMidDays:
    - Wait... No, please!
    dialoguesFinalDays:
    - Wait... mommy!
  quarantineExitLines:
  - This is a mistake. I have notes. I can prove this is a mistake.
  - Fine. At least in here I can keep counting without interruption.
  - "Wait \u2014 are those water stains on the ceiling? That pattern is wrong."
  killExitLines:
  - "No \u2014 I still had variables I hadn\u2019t \u2014 I still hadn\u2019t found
    the \u2014"
  - "The pattern \u2014 there was a pattern \u2014 I almost had it \u2014"
  - I was so close... so close to figuring it all out...
